@@ -0,0 +1,194 @@
+/**
+ * The Daily Grind: client-side analytics.
+ *
+ * Records page views and click interactions, then debounces and batches them
+ * so that every event within BATCH_WINDOW goes out as one deferred background
+ * request. The batch is sent when the window expires or when the user leaves
+ * the page, whichever happens first.
+ *
+ * Uses fetchLater() where the browser supports it, and a small polyfill
